IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT domain
IMPORT `g2-nouns`

-- g2-readings.l4: ready-made values of `Interpretation of Articles 3 to 7`, for the tests and for any caller who wants to choose a reading by name.
-- Data only: no rules, no directives.  `the favoured interpretation of Articles 3 to 7` takes, at every fork point, the reading that FRAGMENT-G2.md (section 2) says is taken;
-- each other value differs from it at exactly ONE fork point, so a test that uses it isolates that fork.
-- The short names F2.1 A, F2.1 B, ... name the constructors of the enumerations, in the order the fields of the record list them.

§ `Readings of the forks of Articles 3 to 7`

§§ `The constructors, by short name`

GIVETH A `How the purposes of an entity are tested in Article 5(1)(a)`
`F2.1 A` MEANS `at least one charitable purpose is required, and an ancillary purpose counts only beside one`
GIVETH A `How the purposes of an entity are tested in Article 5(1)(a)`
`F2.1 B` MEANS `an entity with no purposes satisfies the test vacuously`
GIVETH A `How the purposes of an entity are tested in Article 5(1)(a)`
`F2.1 C` MEANS `purely ancillary purposes satisfy the test without any charitable purpose`

GIVETH A `How "acting in that capacity" qualifies the persons named in Article 5(2)`
`F2.2 A` MEANS `the person must be permitted to act as a Minister, a member of the States Assembly or an equivalent`
GIVETH A `How "acting in that capacity" qualifies the persons named in Article 5(2)`
`F2.2 B` MEANS `any such person is caught however the person is to act`

GIVETH A `What "a Minister" means in Article 5(2)(a)`
`F2.3 A` MEANS `any Minister of the Government of Jersey`
GIVETH A `What "a Minister" means in Article 5(2)(a)`
`F2.3 B` MEANS `only the Minister, as Article 1 defines the term in the text in force`

GIVETH A `How a standard of promptness in Articles 5(7) and 5(8) is measured`
`F2.4 A` MEANS `by an input judgement that the time taken was reasonable or practicable`
GIVETH A `How a standard of promptness in Articles 5(7) and 5(8) is measured`
`F2.4 B` MEANS `by a number of days counted from the event`

GIVETH A `Which head a purpose of advancing a philosophical belief falls within`
`F2.5 A` MEANS `paragraph (1)(p), by the analogy that Article 6(2)(f) states`
GIVETH A `Which head a purpose of advancing a philosophical belief falls within`
`F2.5 B` MEANS `paragraph (1)(c), as if the analogy made it a purpose of advancing religion`

GIVETH A `How the days of a period measured from an event are counted`
`F2.6 A` MEANS `the day of the event is not counted, so the day after it is the first day`
GIVETH A `How the days of a period measured from an event are counted`
`F2.6 B` MEANS `the day of the event is the first day`

GIVETH A `How "before issuing or amending guidance" in Article 5(6) is read`
`F2.7 A` MEANS `the consultation and the report must fall on an earlier day than the day the guidance is issued or amended`
GIVETH A `How "before issuing or amending guidance" in Article 5(6) is read`
`F2.7 B` MEANS `the consultation and the report may fall on the day the guidance is issued or amended`

GIVETH A `Whether the examples in Article 4(3) add to Article 4(2)`
`F2.8 A` MEANS `the examples illustrate Article 4(2) and are bound by its conditions`
GIVETH A `Whether the examples in Article 4(3) add to Article 4(2)`
`F2.8 B` MEANS `each example is a power in its own right`

GIVETH A `How "so far as reasonably practicable" qualifies the standard of conduct in Article 4(4)`
`F2.9 A` MEANS `each limb binds so far as it appeared reasonably practicable`
GIVETH A `How "so far as reasonably practicable" qualifies the standard of conduct in Article 4(4)`
`F2.9 B` MEANS `the standard binds only if it appeared reasonably practicable to act in the whole way`

GIVETH A `What follows from a determination of public benefit made in breach of the duties on its maker`
`F2.10 A` MEANS `the determination does not answer the question`
GIVETH A `What follows from a determination of public benefit made in breach of the duties on its maker`
`F2.10 B` MEANS `the finding of the determination stands`
GIVETH A `What follows from a determination of public benefit made in breach of the duties on its maker`
`F2.10 C` MEANS `the entity is treated as not providing public benefit`

GIVETH A `How "equality and diversity" in Article 6(1)(l) is read`
`F2.11 A` MEANS `a purpose must promote both equality and diversity`
GIVETH A `How "equality and diversity" in Article 6(1)(l) is read`
`F2.11 B` MEANS `a purpose that promotes either equality or diversity suffices`

GIVETH A `Which guidance Articles 5(6) to 5(8) apply to`
`F2.12 A` MEANS `the guidance under Article 5(4), including the guidance on public benefit that Article 7(4) requires it to contain`
GIVETH A `Which guidance Articles 5(6) to 5(8) apply to`
`F2.12 B` MEANS `any guidance that the Commissioner issues or amends`

GIVETH A `Whether a member of the Commissioner's staff exercising the Commissioner's function is bound as the Commissioner is`
`F2.13 A` MEANS `a member of staff exercising a function of the Commissioner under Schedule 1 paragraph 4(3) is bound as the Commissioner is`
GIVETH A `Whether a member of the Commissioner's staff exercising the Commissioner's function is bound as the Commissioner is`
`F2.13 B` MEANS `only the persons that Article 7(1) and Article 5(5) name are bound`

-- F2.14: Article 6(2)(e).  Label: default ruled by the owner (Meng), 2026-10-27 (see FRAGMENT-G2.md, fork F2.14).
GIVETH A `How Article 6(2)(e) is read`
`F2.14 A` MEANS `Article 6(2)(e) is declaratory: relief given by accommodation or care is within paragraph (1)(n) only as relief of those in need`
GIVETH A `How Article 6(2)(e) is read`
`F2.14 B` MEANS `Article 6(2)(e) widens paragraph (1)(n): the provision of accommodation or care is within it without more`

§§ `The interpretations`

-- The reading taken at every fork point (the TYPICALLY of each field of the record).
GIVETH AN `Interpretation of Articles 3 to 7`
`the favoured interpretation of Articles 3 to 7` MEANS
    `Interpretation of Articles 3 to 7` OF `F2.1 A`, `F2.2 A`, `F2.3 A`, `F2.4 A`, `F2.5 A`, `F2.6 A`, `F2.7 A`, `F2.8 A`, `F2.9 A`, `F2.10 A`, `F2.11 A`, `F2.12 A`, `F2.13 A`, `F2.14 A`

